# Allowlist: the image is built from the server sources only. Local data, keys,
# secrets, databases and build output never reach the build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!shared/Cargo.toml
!shared/src/
!shared/update_discovery.rs
!Server/Cargo.toml
!Server/src/
!Client/Windows/Cargo.toml
**/*.der
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db*
